\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Sequential MAS results for Qwen3-8B. Acc. is accuracy (\%), Token values for Single, TextMAS, and Linear are taken from the reference figures. Time for $m\in \{\mathrm  {Single},\mathrm  {TextMAS},\mathrm  {Linear}\}$ is converted to the H200 scale by $T_m^{(H)}=N_m\rho _H$. We use the same-dataset Kernel time-per-token ratio when available and otherwise the H200 Identical ratio. Entries without either H200 ratio are denoted by $-$. Best results in each row are bold. Kernel and Kernel-ES are highlighted. Improve compares the better of Kernel and Kernel-ES with TextMAS. Missing experiment combinations are denoted by $-$.}}{1}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:seq-8b-all-latentmas}{{1}{1}{}{table.1}{}}
